Recommends: obconf
Description: Theme editor for Openbox window manager
 ObTheme is a graphical theme editor for the Openbox window manager.
 It provides an intuitive interface for editing theme properties including
 colors, gradients, fonts, button icons, and other visual elements.
 .
 Features include:
  - Live preview of theme changes
  - Element list and property panel
  - Color palette for easy color selection
  - XBM bitmap editor for button icons
  - Support for all Openbox theme properties
